"An Opposite is the unknown person on another world who gives or receives in a wordchain."
"The Opposite is someone praying for the gift the chain offers."
"A Palace Opposite is someone born as close as possible to the same day and minute."
"An Opposite stone glows when the paired holder does a wordchain, revealing nothing of what."
"Losing an Opposite stone may lead to reassignment; holders should use it every few weeks."
"Receiving an Opposite's pleasant halves piles up debt that must be paid."
